{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Economy log: Mythic+ boons, timed run rewards, Mythical Cache and recycling",
  "contract": [
    "With the economy log on, every Mythic+ reward item writes one reward row with source 3 (Mythic+).",
    "A Mythical Boon (80215) picked up during a run gives the ally beside the clicker one boon item: one row.",
    "Timing the Scarlet Monastery - Armory +1 (keystone 1233152; 80 forces and Herod) gives each member Mythical Caches 2093952 (one row with their count) and Mythic Coins 1414500 (one row); the owner's new keystone is a swap, not a reward.",
    "Opening a Mythical Cache gives one item: one cache_open row with the cache as source.",
    "Upgrading Robes of Arugal (Mythic Dungeon, 1656324) at Edrim into its Mythic 1 version 400168 writes one reward row with the old robes as cost item.",
    "The upgrade's 130 Mythic Coins 1414500 are one store_buy row (source 3) with the coins as cost; Upgrade All writes one such row for its whole price.",
    "Selling the Mythic 1 robes 400168 to Edrim Skysong (416000) recycles them into Mythic Coins: one reward row with the robes as cost item."
  ],
